      "side": 1,
      "message": "The new target from the cl is not exactly an equivalent of `libdiced_open_dice_nostd`. There are several differences:\n\n1. `libdiced_open_dice_nostd` wraps the multi-algorithm version of open-dice lib. It also introduces types like `DiceContext` associated to this version. The new target wraps Ed25519 open-dice and lacks these types.\n\n2. `libdiced_open_dice_nostd` uses a custom `DiceClearMemory` implementation for secure memory handling, while the new target uses the `DiceClearMemory` provided by the upstream open-dice.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 26,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 68
      },
      "revId": "b2fb4846e9a6a4da5a443f3bfb642ca79382c90b",
